  "text": "```verilog\nmodule apbslave #(\n\t\tparameter\tC_APB_ADDR_WIDTH = 12,\n\t\tparameter\tC_APB_DATA_WIDTH = 32,\n\t\tlocalparam\tAW = C_APB_ADDR_WIDTH,\n\t\tlocalparam\tDW = C_APB_DATA_WIDTH,\n\t\tlocalparam\tAPBLSB = $clog2(C_APB_DATA_WIDTH)-3\n\t) (\n\t\tinput\twire\t\t\tPCLK, PRESETn,\n\t\tinput\twire\t\t\tPSEL,\n\t\tinput\twire\t\t\tPENABLE,\n\t\toutput\treg\t\t\tPREADY,\n\t\tinput\twire\t[AW-1:0]\tPADDR,\n\t\tinput\twire\t\t\tPWRITE,\n\t\tinput\twire\t[DW-1:0]\tPWDATA,\n\t\tinput\twire\t[DW/8-1:0]\tPWSTRB,\n\t\tinput\twire\t[2:0]\t\tPPROT,\n\t\toutput\treg\t[DW-1:0]\tPRDATA,\n\t\toutput\twire\t\t\tPSLVERR\n\t);\n\n\t// Internal register file: 256 bytes (64 words)\n\treg [DW-1:0] mem [0:63];\n\n\t// State machine\n\tlocalparam S_IDLE = 1'b0;\n\tlocalparam S_SETUP = 1'b1;\n\n\treg state;\n\n\t// PSLVERR is always 0 for this simple slave\n\tassign PSLVERR = 1'b0;\n\n\t// PREADY is always 1 (no wait states)\n\talways @(*) begin\n\t\tPREADY = 1'b1;\n\tend\n\n\t// State machine\n\talways @(posedge PCLK or negedge PRESETn) begin\n\t\tif (!PRESETn) begin\n\t\t\tstate <= S_IDLE;\n\t\tend else begin\n\t\t\tcase (state)\n\t\t\t\tS_IDLE: begin\n\t\t\t\t\tif (PSEL)\n\t\t\t\t\t\tstate <= S_SETUP;\n\t\t\t\t\telse\n\t\t\t\t\t\tstate <= S_IDLE;\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\tS_SETUP: begin\n\t\t\t\t\tif (PSEL && PENABLE)\n\t\t\t\t\t\tstate <= S_IDLE;\n\t\t\t\t\telse if (!PSEL)\n\t\t\t\t\t\tstate <= S_IDLE;\n\t\t\t\t\telse\n\t\t\t\t\t\tstate <= S_SETUP;\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\tdefault: state <= S_IDLE;\n\t\t\tendcase\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\t// Read data output\n\talways @(posedge PCLK or negedge PRESETn) begin\n\t\tif (!PRESETn) begin\n\t\t\tPRDATA <= {DW{1'b0}};\n\t\tend else begin\n\t\t\tif (state == S_SETUP && PSEL && !PWRITE) begin\n\t\t\t\tPRDATA <= mem[PADDR[AW-1:APBLSB]];\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\t// Write data input\n\talways @(posedge PCLK or negedge PRESETn) begin\n\t\tif (!PRESETn) begin\n\t\t\t// No reset action needed for memory\n\t\tend else begin\n\t\t\tif (state == S_SETUP && PSEL && PWRITE) begin\n\t\t\t\tfor (integer i = 0; i < DW/8; i = i + 1) begin\n\t\t\t\t\tif (PWSTRB[i]) begin\n\t\t\t\t\t\tmem[PADDR[AW-1:APBLSB]][i*8 +: 8] <= PWDATA[i*8 +: 8];\n\t\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\nendmodule\n```<|im_end|>",
